## The email Nick sent (final version)

Sent to the internal working group (James, Scott, Mark, Kimmi). Origin (Morgan/Tayler) deliberately **not** copied at this stage — internal owners' call first.

> **Subject:** Re: 728653T - 40-44 Pakington Street St Kilda - Feasibility study on the installation of EV Chargers
>
> I don't think we should close this out. That would be the wrong call for the building, and short of the job we're here to do as a working group.
>
> Whilst I agree the figure is high, it's about what I'd expect given the scope of work involved. Broken down across the lots it's actually quite reasonable: about $22 per entitlement unit, so roughly $1,060 for the smallest lot up to around $2,730 for the largest, as a one-off.
>
